OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fchance of some rain in the northwest.
OL,7,FProbably staying dry with some clear
OL,8,Fspells in the south and east. Breezy
OL,9,Ffor most, and windy across Pennine
OL,10,Fareas. Mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FTurning cloudy for most parts
OL,13,Fwith chance of some rain, especially
OL,14,Fin the west. Drier with some
OL,15,Fbrightness in the east, especially
OL,16,Facross Humberside. Winds easing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
