OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FTuesday, outbreaks of rain, perhaps
OL,7,Fheavy, clearing slowly. Turning drier
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells developing through
OL,9,FWednesday. Cooler Thursday and mostly
OL,10,Fdry with sunny spells, but showers
OL,11,Fnear coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
